📈 East Java TPT Forecasting Using SES in Excel
Project Overview:
This project analyzes and forecasts the Open Unemployment Rate (TPT) of regencies and cities in East Java using the Single Exponential Smoothing (SES) method in Microsoft Excel.
The analysis is based on TPT data from 2023–2025 obtained from BPS East Java. The SES method with a smoothing constant (α) of 0.5 is applied to identify trends and generate forecasts for 2026.

Objectives:
Analyze unemployment rate trends in East Java.
Apply Single Exponential Smoothing (SES) for time series forecasting.
Generate TPT forecasts for 2026.
Demonstrate data analysis and forecasting skills using Microsoft Excel.

