Method
Single Exponential Smoothing (SES) is calculated using:
St=αXt+(1−α)St−1
Where:
St = Smoothed value
Xt = Actual value
α = Smoothing constant (0.5)
Results
The forecasting results provide estimated TPT values for 2026 across regencies and cities in East Java.

